1
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:05,000
Gu Group is stalling

2
00:00:09,366 --> 00:00:11,366
They haven't covered the real cash flow

3
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:13,066
They are using new collaborations

4
00:00:13,066 --> 00:00:14,833
to cover old deficits

5
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:16,600
Just like before

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,900
On the surface it's an explanation

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,900
but they're actually just shifting the risks

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,100
Lu Group and the bank share this view

9
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:22,866
So Gu Group

10
00:00:22,866 --> 00:00:24,400
sent another visit request this morning

11
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:25,600
It's Gu Chengze again

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,233
It's not a business visit this time

13
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,566
It's a private invitation for Mrs Fu

14
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,300
Want to see him

15
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,600
I'll see him

16
00:00:37,666 --> 00:00:40,366
Mrs Fu, Gu Chengze is desperate right now

17
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,233
He might not just want to talk about the past

18
00:00:42,366 --> 00:00:43,166
I know

19
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,800
That's exactly why I need to see him

20
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,100
He wants to disguise his regret as true love

21
00:00:48,166 --> 00:00:49,200
I don't want to give him space to keep

22
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,433
deluding himself

23
00:00:57,966 --> 00:01:00,000
Mr Fu, are you being protective of your wife
